        "joinerResult": "DIAL_FAILED",
        "close": true,
        "note": "defensive-only：roster 存储事实全部先过 verify()→canonical_bytes()，回执编码不可能后失败——以代码分支+单测映射层覆盖（F 实现发现）"
      },
      {
        "stage": "post_consume",
        "variantId": "post-write-redeem-ok-failed",
        "variant": "REDEEM_OK 回执写入失败",
        "emit": false,
        "kind": null,
        "payloadTemplate": null,
        "joinerResult": "DIAL_FAILED",
        "close": true
      }
    ],
    "_out_of_scope": "RosterError 的 NotRoot（名册 root 缺失）/InvalidRevokeTarget/Corrupted/NotFound/AlreadyExists/DirFabricMismatch 为非 redeem 阶段变体，不经兑换通道发送",
    "_fTestOwner": "F 为 rows 逐行（按 variantId）提供构造测试：consume-already-used 绑定 canonical fixture 断言 TOKEN_CONSUMED；verify-wrong-fabric/not-root/expired/recipient/bad-pop 各一（断言 kind 数值与归一化 payload，外层 0x14 单记录）；全部 emit=false 行各一（断言无结构化帧 + 连接关闭 + joiner DIAL_FAILED）。**旧文本 REDEEM_ERR 发送路径与 Ok(false) 静默返回必须删除**（tasks 3.4）。"
  },
  "cases": [
    {
